### Final Product Direction

Pattern Forge should become the blueprint for how learning works throughout Tutorial Hub.

The same content contracts, visualization framework, assessment engine, mastery model, and revision system should power every academy.

The expected outcome is:

* One consistent learning experience.

* One reusable content architecture.

* One unified learner profile.

* Verified and structured educational content.

* Interactive learning rather than passive reading.

* Evidence-based mastery.

* Consistent progress across all academies.

The guiding principle: Build one excellent learning experience in Pattern Forge first. Then make every Tutorial Hub academy use that same proven learning standard.
